{
  "id": "g-demonstratives",
  "grammarId": "demonstratives",
  "title": "Demostrativos: 这 / 那 / 哪",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "g-demonstratives-001",
      "type": "fill-blank",
      "skill": "grammar",
      "level": 1,
      "zh": "＿是什么？",
      "answer": "这",
      "options": ["这", "这儿", "哪", "哪儿"],
      "es": "¿Qué es esto?",
      "py": "Zhè shì shénme?",
      "grammarIds": ["demonstratives", "question-words"],
      "explain": "«Esto» como sujeto de 是 es 这. 这儿 significa «aquí» (lugar) y 哪/哪儿 son interrogativos."
    },
    {
      "id": "g-demonstratives-002",
      "type": "fill-blank",
      "skill": "grammar",
      "level": 1,
      "zh": "你去＿？",
      "answer": "哪儿",
      "options": ["哪儿", "哪", "这", "那"],
      "es": "¿Adónde vas?",
      "py": "Nǐ qù nǎr?",
      "grammarIds": ["demonstratives", "question-words"],
      "explain": "«Dónde» es 哪儿 (哪 + 儿). 哪 solo significa «cuál» y necesita un clasificador o nombre detrás."
    },
    {
      "id": "g-demonstratives-003",
      "type": "fill-blank",
      "skill": "grammar",
      "level": 1,
      "zh": "洗手间在＿？",
      "answer": "哪儿",
      "options": ["哪儿", "哪个", "这", "那"],
      "es": "¿Dónde está el baño?",
